hadiths[139]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Hum sab se baad mein hone ke bawajood Qiyamat ke din sab se aage honge, farq sirf itna hai ke unhein hum se pehle Kitab di gayi to unhon ne us mein ikhtilaf kiya, aur hamein un ke baad di gayi. Yahi un ka woh din tha jo un par farz kiya gaya tha, unhon ne us mein ikhtilaf kiya, to Allah ne hamein us ki hidayat di, chunache woh is mein hamare tabe ho gaye: Yahood kal aur Nasara parson."
"2","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Meri aur mujh se pehle ke nabiyon ki misal us shakhs jaisi hai jis ne ghar banaye, unhein khoob achha, khoobsurat aur mukammal kiya, siwaye ek kone mein ek eent ki jagah ke. Log ghoomne lage aur imarat unhein bhane lagi, aur kehne lage: yahan ek eent kyun na rakhi gayi jis se us ki imarat mukammal ho jati?"" Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""To main hi woh eent hoon."
"3","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bakheel aur sadqa dene wale ki misal do shakhs jaisi hai jin par lohe ke do kurte ya do zirah hon, un ke seenon ya hansli tak. Jab sadqa dene wala koi cheez sadqa karta hai to woh us ki khaal se door hoti jati hai yahan tak ke us ki ungliyon ko dhaanp leti hai aur us ka nishan mitati jati hai. Aur jab bakheel koi cheez kharch karta hai ya dil mein us ka irada karta hai to har kadi apni jagah kaatne lagti hai; woh use kushada karna chahta hai magar woh kushada nahin hoti."
"4","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Meri misal us shakhs jaisi hai jis ne aag jalayi. Jab us ne aaspaas ko raushan kar diya to patange aur yeh janwar jo aag mein girte hain us mein girne lage, aur woh unhein rokne laga magar woh us par ghalib aa gaye aur us mein koodne lage. Yahi meri aur tumhari misal hai: main tumhein kamaron se pakad kar aag se bachana chahta hoon, aag se bacho, aag se bacho, magar tum mujh par ghalib aa jate ho aur us mein kood padte ho."
"5","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saye mein sawar sau saal chalega to bhi use paar na kar sakega."
"6","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Badgumani se bacho, badgumani se bacho, badgumani se bacho, kyunke badgumani sab se jhooti baat hai. Najash na karo [bina khareed ke irade ke boli badhana], aapas mein hasad na karo, [khudgharz] muqabla na karo, bughz na rakho, peeth na phero, aur Allah ke bando, bhai-bhai ban jao."
"7","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jume ke din ek ghadi hai, koi Musalman namaz padhte hue apne Rab se koi cheez mange to Woh use zaroor ata karta hai."
"8","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Farishte tum mein baari-baari aate hain, raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte, aur woh Fajr aur Asr ki namaz mein jama hote hain. Phir jo tumhare paas raat guzarte hain Woh us ki taraf chadhte hain, to Woh un se poochta hai, halanke Woh unhein sab se zyada janta hai: tum ne Mere bandon ko kis haal mein chhoda? Woh kehte hain: hum ne unhein namaz padhte chhoda, aur hum un ke paas aaye to woh namaz padh rahe thay."
"9","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Farishte tum mein se har ek ke liye dua karte hain jab tak woh apne musalle par baitha rahe jahan us ne namaz padhi, aur kehte hain: Ae Allah! use bakhsh de, Ae Allah! us par reham farma, jab tak woh behadas na ho."
"10","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi aameen kahe aur farishte aasman mein aameen kahein, phir ek doosre ke muwafiq ho jaye to us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jate hain."
"11","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: ek shakhs qilade wali qurbani ki oontni haank raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho ja."" Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Yeh to qurbani ka janwar hai. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tujh par afsos! Us par sawar ho ja, tujh par afsos! Us par sawar ho ja."
"12","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo main janta hoon agar tum jaan lete to bahut rote aur kam hanste."
"13","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se lade to chehre [par marne] se bache."
"14","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tumhari yeh aag jise bani Aadam jalate hain Jahannam ki garmi ke sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai."" Logon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Yeh to hamare liye kaafi thi. Aap ne farmaya: ""Use us par unsath hisson se fazeelat di gayi hai, har hissa usi ki garmi jaisa hai."
"15","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab Allah ne makhlooq ka faisla kiya to ek kitab likhi jo Us ke paas Arsh ke oopar hai: beshak Meri rehmat Mere ghazab par sabqat le gayi hai."
"16","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Roza dhal hai, jab tum mein se koi kisi din rozedar ho to na jihalat kare na behayai ki baat kahe. Agar koi us se lade ya use gaali de to kahe: main rozedar hoon, main rozedar hoon."
"17","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushboo se zyada pasandeeda hai. Woh Meri khatir apni khwahish, khana aur peena chhodta hai; roza Mere liye hai aur Main hi us ka badla doonga."
"18","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Nabiyon mein se ek Nabi ek darakht ke neeche utre, ek cheonti ne unhein kaat liya, to unhon ne hukm diya chunache un ka saman neeche se nikal liya gaya, phir hukm diya to unhein aag mein jala diya gaya. To Allah ne un ki taraf wahy ki: sirf ek cheonti kyun na [saza di]?"
"19","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, agar momineen par mashaqqat ka dar na hota to Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wale kisi lashkar ke peeche na baithta. Lekin mere paas itni gunjaish nahin ke unhein sawar karoon, na un ke paas gunjaish hai ke mere peeche chalein, na un ke dilon ko achha lagta hai ke mere baad baithe rahein."
"20","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Har Nabi ke liye ek qubool hone wali dua hai, to main chahta hoon - InshaAllah - ke apni dua ko Qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki shafa'at ke liye muakhkhar rakhoon."
"21","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand karta hai, aur jo Allah se mulaqat ko pasand nahin karta Allah us se mulaqat ko pasand nahin karta."
"22","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jis ne meri ita'at ki us ne Allah ki ita'at ki, aur jis ne meri nafarmani ki us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki. Jis ne ameer ki ita'at ki us ne meri ita'at ki, aur jis ne ameer ki nafarmani ki us ne meri nafarmani ki."
"23","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tum mein maal kasrat se ho jaye phir behne lage, yahan tak ke maal wale ko fikr hogi ke us ka sadqa kaun qubool karega."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur ilm utha liya jayega, zamana qareeb hoga, fitne zahir honge aur harj kasrat se hoga."" Logon ne kaha: harj kya hai Ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: ""Qatl, qatl."
"24","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke do badi jama'atein aapas mein ladein, un ke darmiyan bada qatl-e-aam ho, halanke un ka daawa ek hi hoga."
"25","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tees ke qareeb jhoote dajjal niklein, har ek ka daawa hoga ke woh Allah ka Rasool hai."
"26","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke sooraj maghrib se nikle. Jab woh niklega aur log use dekhenge to sab eeman le aayenge, aur woh waqt hoga jab kisi jaan ko us ka eeman faida na dega jo pehle eeman na layi thi ya apne eeman mein bhalayi na kamayi thi."
"27","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab namaz ke liye pukara jata hai to shaitan peeth pher kar goz marta hua bhagta hai taake azan na sune. Jab azan poori ho jati hai to laut aata hai, phir jab iqamat kahi jati hai to peeth pher deta hai, phir jab iqamat poori ho jati hai to laut aata hai, aadmi aur us ke nafs ke darmiyan waswasa dalta hai aur kehta hai: falan yaad kar, falan yaad kar, jo pehle yaad na tha, yahan tak ke aadmi nahin janta ke us ne kaise namaz padhi."
"28","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ka dayan haath bhara hua hai, raat-din ka musalsal kharch use kam nahin karta. Kya tum ne dekha jo Us ne aasman aur zameen ki paidaish se kharch kiya? Beshak us ne Us ke dayein haath mein jo hai use kam nahin kiya."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur Us ka Arsh pani par hai aur Us ke doosre haath mein qabz hai: buland karta hai aur past karta hai."
"29","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, tum mein se har ek par zaroor ek din aayega jab woh mujhe na dekhega, phir mujhe dekhna use apne gharwalon aur maal ke barabar se zyada mehboob hoga."
"30","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisra halak hoga phir us ke baad koi Kisra na hoga, aur Qaisar zaroor halak hoga phir us ke baad koi Qaisar na hoga. Aur un ke khazane zaroor Allah ki raah mein kharch kiye jayenge."" Aur Aap ne jang ko dhokha kaha."
"31","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah ne farmaya: Main ne apne nek bandon ke liye woh tayyar kiya hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha, na kisi kaan ne suna, na kisi insan ke dil mein aaya."
"32","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mujhe chhod do jab tak main tumhein chhodoon, kyunke tum se pehle wale apne sawalon aur apne nabiyon se ikhtilaf ke sabab halak hue. Jab main tumhein kisi cheez se mana karoon to us se bacho, aur jab kisi kaam ka hukm doon to us mein se jitna ho sake karo."
"33","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab Fajr ki namaz ke liye pukara jaye aur tum mein se koi junubi [halat-e-janabat mein] ho to woh us din roza na rakhe."
"34","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ke ninyanwe naam hain, ek kam sau; jis ne unhein yaad [mehfooz] kiya woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Beshak Woh taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai."
"35","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi us shakhs ko dekhe jise maal aur soorat mein us par fazeelat di gayi hai to woh us shakhs ko dekhe jo us se neeche hai, jin par use fazeelat di gayi hai."
"36","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kisi ke bartan ki paaki jab kutta us mein munh dale: use saat baar dhoye."
"37","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, main ne pakka irada kiya tha ke apne naujawano ko hukm doon ke mere liye lakdiyon ke gatthe tayyar karein, phir ek shakhs ko hukm doon ke logon ko namaz padhaye, phir gharon ko un mein rehne walon samet jala doon."
"38","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se kisi ki jooti ka tasma toot jaye to ek jooti mein aur doosri [nange paon] na chale; dono utar de ya dono pehen le."
"39","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Nazr ibne Aadam ke liye woh cheez nahin lati jo Main ne muqaddar na ki ho, balke nazr use usi se milati hai jo Main ne us ke liye muqaddar kiya: Main us ke zariye bakheel se [maal] nikalta hoon, aur woh us par Mujhe woh deta hai jo pehle Mujhe na deta tha."
"40","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah ne farmaya: kharch kar, tujh par kharch kiya jayega."" Aur Aap ne jang ko dhokha kaha."
"41","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Eesa ibne Maryam alaihissalam ne ek shakhs ko chori karte dekha to us se farmaya: kya tu ne chori ki? Us ne kaha: hargiz nahin, qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke siwa koi mabood nahin. To Eesa ne farmaya: main Allah par eeman laya aur apni aankh ko jhoota thehraya."
"42","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Meri rob se madad ki gayi hai aur mujhe jameul-kalim [mukhtasar magar jame baatein] ata kiye gaye hain."
"43","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Main tumhein kuch deta nahin aur na tum se rokta hoon; main sirf khazin hoon, jahan hukm pata hoon rakhta hoon."
"44","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Imam sirf is liye hai ke us ki iqtida ki jaye, us se ikhtilaf na karo. Jab woh takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho; jab woh ruku kare to ruku karo; jab woh kahe: Sami'allahu liman hamidah, to kaho: Allahumma Rabbana lakal-hamd; jab woh sajda kare to sajda karo; aur jab woh baith kar namaz padhe to sab baith kar padho."
"45","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Namaz mein saf seedhi karo, kyunke saf seedhi karna achhi namaz mein se hai."
"46","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Aadam aur Moosa mein behes hui. Moosa ne un se kaha: kya Aap wahi Aadam hain jinhon ne logon ko gumrah kiya aur unhein Jannat se nikal kar zameen par utara? Aadam ne un se kaha: kya Aap wahi Moosa hain jinhein Allah ne har cheez ka ilm diya aur apni risalat se logon par barguzeeda kiya? Unhon ne kaha: haan. Unhon ne kaha: kya Aap mujhe us kaam par malamat karte hain jo mere paida hone se pehle mujh par likh diya gaya tha? Chunache Aadam Moosa par ghalib aaye."
"47","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek baar Ayyoob nange ghusl kar rahe thay, un par sone ki tiddiyon ka jhund gira, to Ayyoob apne kapde mein sametne lage."" Aap ne farmaya: ""To un ke Rab ne unhein pukara: Ae Ayyoob! Kya Main ne tujhe us se beniyaz na kiya tha jo tu dekhta hai? Unhon ne kaha: kyun nahin Ae mere Rab! Lekin Teri barkat se mujhe koi beniyazi nahin."
"48","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Daood par Quran [Zaboor] aasan kar diya gaya tha: woh apni sawariyon ko zeen kasne ka hukm dete, aur un ki sawari ke zeen kasne se pehle Quran padh lete, aur sirf apne haath ki kamayi se khate thay."
"49","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Nek aadmi ka khwab nubuwwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"50","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Chhota bade ko, chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thode zyada ko salam karein."
"51","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Main logon se ladta rahoonga yahan tak ke woh kahein: La ilaha illallah. Jab woh kahein: La ilaha illallah, to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon, maal aur jaanein bacha leen - siwaye us ke haq ke; aur un ka hisab Allah par hai."
"52","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jannat aur Jahannam mein behes hui. Jahannam ne kaha: mutakabbireen aur zabardasti karne walon se mujhe tarjeeh di gayi hai. Jannat ne kaha: mujhe kya hai ke logon mein se zaeef, haqeer aur bhole hi mujh mein dakhil hote hain? To Allah ne Jannat se farmaya: tu to Meri rehmat hai, tere zariye Main apne bandon mein se jise chahoon reham karta hoon. Aur Jahannam se farmaya: tu to Mera azab hai, tere zariye Main apne bandon mein se jise chahoon azab deta hoon. Tum dono mein se har ek ka bharna hai. Rahi Jahannam, woh na bharegi yahan tak ke Woh us mein Apna qadam rakhe, to woh kahegi: bas! bas! Wahin woh bhar jayegi aur ek hissa doosre se simat jayega, aur Allah apni makhlooq mein se kisi par zulm na karega. Aur rahi Jannat, to Allah us ke liye nayi makhlooq paida karega."
"53","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi dhelon se istinja kare to taaq [adad] mein kare."
"54","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: jab Mera banda neki karne ki niyyat karta hai to Main us ke liye use ek neki likh deta hoon jab tak woh use na kare; jab woh use karta hai to Main us ke liye use das guna likh deta hoon. Aur jab woh burayi ki niyyat karta hai to Main use maaf karta hoon jab tak woh use na kare; jab woh use karta hai to Main us ke liye use us ke barabar [ek] likhta hoon."
"55","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ki qasam! Jannat mein tum mein se kisi ke kode rakhne ki jagah us ke liye aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan jo hai us se behtar hai."
"56","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Jannat mein tum mein se kisi ke sab se chhote maqam wale se kaha jayega: tamanna kar! To woh tamanna karega aur tamanna karega, phir us se kaha jayega: kya tu ne tamanna kar li? Woh kahega: haan. To us se kaha jayega: tere liye jo tu ne tamanna kiya aur us ke saath utna aur hai."
"57","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se ek fard hota. Agar log kisi ghati ya wadi mein chalein aur Ansar doosri ghati mein, to main Ansar ke saath un ki ghati mein chalta."
"58","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar bani Israel na hote to khana kharab na hota aur gosht na sadta; aur agar Hawwa na hotein to koi aurat kabhi apne shauhar se khiyanat na karti."
"59","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ne Aadam alaihissalam ko un ki soorat par paida kiya, un ki lambayi saath haath thi. Jab unhein paida kiya to farmaya: ja, us jama'at ko salam kar - woh farishton ki baithi jama'at hain - aur sun woh tujhe kya jawab dete hain, kyunke wahi tera aur teri aulad ka salam hoga."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir woh gaye aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum. Unhon ne kaha: Wa alaikumussalam wa rehmatullah, unhon ne warehmatullah badhaya."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Har woh jo Jannat mein dakhil hoga Aadam ki soorat par hoga, lambayi saath haath. Phir ab tak makhlooq ghatti rahi hai."
"60","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Malakul-maut Moosa ke paas aaye aur un se kaha: apne Rab ki pukar qubool karo. To Moosa ne Malakul-maut ki aankh par thappad mara aur use phod diya. Farishta Allah Azza wa Jalla ke paas lauta aur kaha: Tu ne mujhe apne aise bande ki taraf bheja hai jo maut nahin chahta, aur us ne meri aankh phod di hai. To Allah ne us ki aankh lauta di aur farmaya: Mere bande ke paas laut ja aur us se keh: kya tu zindagi chahta hai? Agar tu zindagi chahta hai to bail ki peeth par apna haath rakh, tere haath ne jitne baal dhaanke, har baal ke badle tu ek saal jiyega. Unhon ne kaha: phir kya? Unhon ne kaha: phir tu marega. Unhon ne kaha: to abhi qareeb se [maut behtar]. Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe muqaddas zameen ke qareeb patthar phenkne ki doori par kar de."" Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar main wahan hota to tumhein laal teele ke paas raste ke kinare un ki qabr dikhata."
"61","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bani Israel nange ghusl karte thay, ek doosre ki sharmgah dekhte thay, aur Moosa akele ghusl karte thay. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Moosa ko hamare saath ghusl se sirf yahi rokta hai ke woh foton ke phoolne ki beemari mein mubtela hain. Ek baar woh ghusl karne gaye aur apna kapda patthar par rakha, to patthar un ke kapde lekar bhaga. Moosa us ke peeche daude aur kehte jate: mera kapda, ae patthar! Mera kapda, ae patthar! Yahan tak ke bani Israel ne Moosa ki sharmgah dekhi, to kaha: Allah ki qasam! Moosa mein koi aib nahin. Phir patthar dekha jane ke baad thehar gaya, unhon ne apna kapda liya aur patthar ko peetne lage."" Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Patthar par Moosa ke maarne se chhe ya saat nishan hain."
"62","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Maal ki kasrat ghina nahin hai, balke ghina to dil ka ghina hai."
"63","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak maldar ka [qarz mein] talmatol zulm hai, aur jab tum mein se kisi ka qarz kisi maldar par hawala kiya jaye to woh usi ke peeche jaye."
"64","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se zyada ghazab wala, khabees aur ghazabnak woh shakhs hoga jis ka naam Malikul-amlaak rakha gaya tha; Allah Azza wa Jalla ke siwa koi badshah nahin."
"65","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek shakhs do chadaron mein itrata chal raha tha, apne aap par farefta tha, to use zameen mein dhansa diya gaya, aur woh Qiyamat tak us mein dhansta rahega."
"66","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Main apne bande ke guman ke paas hoon."
"67","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo paida hota hai isi fitrat par paida hota hai, phir us ke maan-baap use Yahoodi aur Eisayi banate hain, jaise tum maweshi paida karate ho: kya tum us mein koi kati-kuti pate ho yahan tak ke tum khud use kaatte ho? Logon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Jo chhota mar jaye us ke bare mein kya farmate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah sab se zyada janta hai jo woh karne wale thay."
"68","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak insan mein ek haddi hai jise zameen kabhi nahin khati, usi mein Qiyamat ke din [use] joda jayega."" Logon ne kaha: kaun si haddi? Aap ne farmaya: ""Dum ki jad [coccyx]."" Aur Abul-Hasan ne kaha: asal mein ajm hai, lekin unhon ne meem se kaha."
"69","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Wisal [musalsal roze] se bacho, wisal se bacho."" Logon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap to wisal karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: ""Main is mein tumhari tarah nahin hoon. Main raat is haal mein guzarta hoon ke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. To amal ki utni takleef uthao jitni tumhein taqat hai."
"70","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi jage to wuzu ke pani par haath rakhne se pehle use dho le, kyunke tum mein se koi nahin janta ke us ka haath raat mein kahan raha."
"71","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Logon ke har jod par har din sadqa hai jis din sooraj nikalta hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Do ke darmiyan adal karna sadqa hai, aadmi ki sawari mein madad karna aur use us par sawar karana ya us ka saman us par uthana sadqa hai, achhi baat sadqa hai, namaz ki taraf har qadam sadqa hai, aur raste se takleef door karna sadqa hai."
"72","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab maweshi ka malik us ka haq [zakat] na de to Qiyamat ke din woh us par chadha diye jayenge, us ke chehre ko apne khuron se raundenge."
"73","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat ke din tum mein se kisi ka khazana ganja saanp hoga, us ka malik us se bhagega aur woh use talash karega aur kahega: main tera khazana hoon."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ki qasam! Woh musalsal use talash karta rahega yahan tak ke woh apna haath phailayega to woh use munh mein le lega."
"74","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Thehre pani mein peshab na kiya jaye jo behta na ho, phir us se ghusl kiya jaye."
"75","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Miskeen woh ghoomne wala nahin jo logon ke paas chakkar lagata hai, ek-do luqme aur ek-do khajoorein use lauta deti hain. Miskeen to woh hai jo itna maal na paye jo use ghani kare, logon se mangne mein sharmaye, aur pehchana na jaye ke us par sadqa kiya jaye."
"76","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Koi aurat apne shauhar ki maujoodgi mein us ki ijazat ke baghair [nafli] roza na rakhe, aur us ki maujoodgi mein us ke ghar mein us ki ijazat ke baghair kisi ko aane ki ijazat na de. Aur us ki kamayi se us ke hukm ke baghair jo kharch karegi to us ke aadhe ajr ka haqdar shauhar hoga."
"77","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi maut ki tamanna na kare aur us ke aane se pehle us ki dua na kare. Jab tum mein se koi marta hai to us ka amal - ya farmaya us ki muddat - kat jati hai, aur momin ki umar sirf bhalayi badhati hai."
"78","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi angoor ko karam na kahe; karam to sirf Musalman mard hai."
"79","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek shakhs ne doosre se zameen khareedi; khareedar ko apni zameen mein sone se bhara ghada mila. Khareedar ne us se kaha: apna sona mujh se le lo; main ne tum se sirf zameen khareedi thi, sona nahin khareeda tha. Zameen bechne wale ne kaha: main ne tumhein zameen aur jo us mein tha becha tha. Dono ek shakhs ke paas faisle ke liye gaye. Faisal ne un se kaha: kya tumhari aulad hai? Ek ne kaha: mera ladka hai. Doosre ne kaha: meri ladki hai. Us ne kaha: ladke ka ladki se nikah kar do, us mein se apne oopar kharch karo aur sadqa karo."
"80","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tum mein se koi apni sawari se khush hota hai jab woh us se gum ho jaye phir woh use pa le?"" Logon ne kaha: haan, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Jab banda tauba karta hai to Allah us ke tauba se us se kahin zyada khush hota hai jitna tum mein se koi apni sawari pane par khush hota hai."
"81","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: jab Mera banda Meri taraf ek balisht badhta hai to Main us ki taraf ek haath badhta hoon; jab woh Meri taraf ek haath badhta hai to Main us ki taraf do haath badhta hoon; aur jab woh Meri taraf do haath badhta hai to Main us ki taraf aata hoon - ya farmaya: tezi se aata hoon."
"82","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare to nathnon se pani chadhaye phir use jhade."
"83","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Agar mere paas Uhud [pahad] barabar sona hota to chahta ke teen raatein guzarne se pehle sab de doon, aur mere paas us mein se ek deenar na rahe jis ka lene wala main paoon, siwaye us ke jo apne qarz ke liye rokoon."
"84","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab bawarchi tumhare paas tumhara khana lekar aaye jis ne tumhein us ki garmi aur dhuein se beniyaz kiya hai, to use bulao ke tumhare saath khaye, warna us ke haath mein [kuch] thama do."
"85","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: apne rab ko pilao, apne rab ko khilao ya apne rab ko wuzu karao; aur tum mein se koi 'mera rab' na kahe; woh kahe: mera sardar aur mera maula. Aur tum mein se koi 'mera ghulam, meri laundi' na kahe; woh kahe: mera naujawan, meri naujawan, mera naukar."
"86","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jannat mein dakhil hone wala pehla giroh, un ki sooratein chaudahvin raat ke chaand jaisi hongi. Woh us mein na thookenge, na naak saaf karenge, na hajat karenge. Un ke bartan aur kanghe sone-chandi ke honge, un ki angeethiyan ood ki lakdi ki, un ka paseena mushk; un mein se har ek ki do beeviyan hongi, khoobsurti ke sabab gosht ke peeche se un ki pindliyon ka gooda dikhega. Un mein na ikhtilaf hoga na bughz, un ke dil ek dil jaise honge, subah-shaam Allah ki tasbeeh karenge."
"87","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Main Tere paas ek ahad leta hoon jise Tu kabhi khilaf na karega. Main to ek insan hoon; main ne jis momin ko takleef di ho, bura kaha ho, kode mare hon ya laanat ki ho, to use namaz, zakat aur qurbat bana de jis se Tu use Qiyamat ke din qareeb kare."
"88","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Hum se pehli ummaton ke liye ghaneemat halal na thi; kyunke Allah ne hamari kamzori aur aajizi dekhi to use hamare liye tayyab [halal] kiya."
"89","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek aurat apni billi ke sabab Jahannam mein dakhil hui - us ne use bandh rakha tha; na use khilaya, na chhoda ke zameen ke keede kha le - yahan tak ke woh dubli ho kar mar gayi."
"90","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Chor jab chori karta hai to momin rehte hue chori nahin karta; zani jab zina karta hai to momin rehte hue nahin karta; tum mein se koi jab sharab - yani nasheeli cheez - peeta hai to momin rehte hue nahin peeta. Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Tum mein se koi jab izzat wali loot loot-ta hai jis ki taraf momin aankhein uthate hain to momin rehte hue nahin loot-ta; tum mein se koi jab khiyanat karta hai to momin rehte hue nahin karta. Bacho, bacho [inse]."
"91","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam Us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Is ummat ka jo bhi - Yahoodi ya Eisayi - mere bare mein sune, phir main jis ke saath bheja gaya hoon us par eeman laye baghair mar jaye, woh Jahannamiyon mein se hoga."
"92","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Namaz mein [Imam ko aagah karne ke liye] mardon ke liye tasbeeh hai aur aurton ke liye taali."
"93","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Musalman ko Allah ki raah mein jo zakhm lage, Qiyamat ke din woh usi haalat mein aayega jaise zakhm lagne ke waqt tha: khoon behta hoga, rang khoon ka rang, aur khushboo mushk ki khushboo."
"94","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Main apne ghar walon ke paas lauta hoon aur apne bistar par ya ghar mein giri khajoor pata hoon, use khane ke liye uthata hoon; phir darta hoon ke woh sadqe [ke maal] se ho, to use chhod deta hoon."
"95","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum sawal karte hi rahoge yahan tak ke tum mein se koi kahega: yeh Allah hai jis ne makhlooq paida ki, to Allah ko kis ne paida kiya?"
"96","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kisi ka apne gharwalon ke bare mein qasam par adna Allah ke nazdeek us ke liye zyada gunah hai, us ke kaffare dene se jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farz kiya hai."
"97","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab do ko qasam par majboor kiya jaye aur dono qasam khana chahein to un ke darmiyan qura dala jaye."
"98","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi doodh roki hui [musarrat] oontni ya bakri khareede, doohne ke baad use do mein se behtar ikhtiyar hai: ya to woh, warna use lauta de aur ek sa'a khajoor [doodh ke badle] de."
"99","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Boodha do cheezon ki muhabbat mein jawan rehta hai: lambi umar aur kasrat-e-maal."
"100","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki taraf hathiyar se ishara na kare; tum mein se koi nahin janta, shayad shaitan us ke haath mein use chheen le, to woh Jahannam ke gadhhe mein gire."
"101","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek qaum par Allah ka ghazab sakht hua jinhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath aisa kiya"" - us waqt Aap apne samne ke daant ki taraf ishara kar rahe thay."
"102","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Us shakhs par Allah ka ghazab sakht hua jise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Allah ki raah mein qatl karein."
"103","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ibne Aadam par zina ka ek hissa hai jise woh zaroor payega. Aankh ka zina nazar hai aur us ki tasdeeq munh pherna hai; zuban ka zina baat hai, dil ka zina tamanna hai; aur sharmgah us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya jhutlati hai."
"104","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi apne Islam ko achha kar le to woh jo neki karta hai woh das guna se saat sau guna tak likhi jati hai; aur jo burayi karta hai woh us ke barabar [ek] likhi jati hai - yahan tak ke woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se mile."
"105","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi logon ki imamat kare to namaz halki kare; kyunke un mein boodhe, kamzor aur beemar hain. Aur akela padhe to jitna chahe lambi kare."
"106","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Farishton ne kaha: Ae Rab! Yeh banda burayi karna chahta hai - halanke Woh use sab se zyada dekhta hai. Farmaya: us ki nigrani karo; agar woh use kare to us ke liye us ke barabar likho; aur agar use chhod de to us ke liye ek neki likho; us ne to Meri khatir chhoda hai."
"107","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: ""Mere bande ne Mujhe jhutlaya, halanke yeh us ke liye nahin tha; Mere bande ne Mujhe gaali di, halanke yeh us ke liye nahin tha. Mujhe jhutlana us ka yeh kehna hai: woh hamein lautayega nahin jaise us ne hamein shuru kiya tha. Aur Mujhe gaali dena us ka yeh kehna hai: Allah ne beta banaya; halanke Main As-Samad hoon, na Main ne jana na Main jana gaya, aur Mera koi hamsar nahin."
"108","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Garmi mein namaz thandi karke [der se] padho; kyunke sakht garmi Jahannam ki bhaap se hai."
"109","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kisi ki namaz qubool nahin hoti jab woh behadas ho jaye yahan tak ke woh wuzu kare."
"110","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab namaz ke liye pukara jaye to us ke paas chalte hue aao aur tum par sukoon ho. Jitni pao padho, aur jo reh jaye use poora karo."
"111","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah do shakhs par hansta hai jin mein se ek doosre ko qatl karta hai; dono Jannat mein dakhil hote hain."" Logon ne kaha: kaise, Ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh qatl kiya jata hai aur Jannat mein dakhil hota hai; phir Allah doosre ki tauba qubool karta hai aur use Islam ki hidayat deta hai; phir woh Allah ki raah mein jihad karta hai aur shaheed hota hai."
"112","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare, na us ke paigham par paigham bheje."
"113","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kafir saat aanton mein khata hai, aur momin ek aant mein khata hai."
"114","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Khizr ko Khizr is liye kaha gaya kyunke woh safed [khushk] chamde par baithe, to woh un ke neeche hari ho kar hilne lagi."
"115","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah Qiyamat ke din us shakhs ki taraf na dekhega jo [takabbur se kapda] latkaye - yani apni izar [takhnon se neeche]."
"116","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bani Israel se kaha gaya: darwaze se sajda karte hue dakhil ho aur kaho hittah, tumhare gunah bakhsh diye jayenge. To unhon ne badal diya: woh darwaze se apni sureenon par rengte hue dakhil hue aur kaha: baal mein dana."
"117","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi raat ko uthe aur Quran us ki zuban par atak jaye aur woh na jane kya kehta hai, to let jaye."
"118","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: ""Ibne Aadam na kahe: haye zamane ki namuradi! Kyunke Main hi zamana hoon: Main raat aur din bhejta hoon, jab chahoon unhein rok loon."
"119","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ghulam ke liye kitna achha hai ke Allah use apne Rab ki aur apne aaqa ki achhi ita'at par maut de. Us ke liye kitna achha, kitna achha."
"120","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi namaz ke liye khada ho to apne samne na thooke; kyunke woh jab tak apne musalle mein hai Allah se sargoshi karta hai, na dayin taraf, kyunke dayin taraf farishta hai. Balke bayin taraf ya paon ke neeche thooke, phir use dafan kare."
"121","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tu logon se kahe: khamosh raho - halanke woh baat kar rahe hon - yani Jume ke din - to tu ne khud laghw kiya."
"122","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ki kitab mein main momineen ka sab se zyada haqdar hoon. Tum mein se jo qarz ya besahara gharwale chhod jaye to mujhe pukaro, main us ka wali hoon. Aur jo maal chhod jaye to woh us ke asaba rishtedaron ka hai, woh jo bhi hon."
"123","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: Ae Allah! Agar Tu chahe to mujhe bakhsh de, ya mujh par reham farma agar Tu chahe, ya mujhe rizq de agar Tu chahe. Woh pukhtagi se mange; Woh jo chahta hai karta hai, use koi majboor karne wala nahin."
"124","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Nabiyon mein se ek Nabi ne jihad kiya, to apni qaum se kaha: mere peeche woh shakhs na aaye jis ne aurat hasil ki ho, us se ghar basana chahta ho magar abhi na basaya ho; na doosra jis ne imarat banayi ho magar us ki chhat na uthayi ho; na doosra jis ne bakriyan ya gabhin oontniyan khareedi hon aur un ke byane ka intezar kar raha ho. Phir unhon ne jihad kiya aur basti ke qareeb pahunche jab Asr padhi ya us ke qareeb, to sooraj se kaha: tu bhi hukm ki paband hai aur main bhi hukm ka paband hoon. Ae Allah! Use mere liye kuch der rok de. To Allah ne unhein fatah dene tak use rok diya. Unhon ne ghaneemat jama ki, to aag use khane aayi magar us ne khane se inkar kiya. Unhon ne kaha: tum mein ghulool [ghaneemat mein khiyanat] hai, har qabeele se ek shakhs meri bai'at kare. Unhon ne bai'at ki aur ek shakhs ka haath un ke haath se chipak gaya. Unhon ne kaha: tum mein ghulool hai, tumhara qabeela meri bai'at kare. Us ke qabeele ne bai'at ki aur do-teen shakhs ke haath un ke haath se chipak gaye. Unhon ne kaha: tum mein ghulool hai, tum ne khiyanat ki hai. To unhon ne gaaye ke sir barabar sona nikala aur maidan mein maal mein rakha, to aag aayi aur use kha gayi."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Hum se pehle kisi ke liye ghanaim halal na theen; kyunke Allah ne hamari kamzori aur aajizi dekhi to unhein hamare liye halal kiya."
"125","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek baar main soya tha, dekha ke main hauz se pani nikal kar logon ko pila raha hoon. Phir Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) mere paas aaye aur mujhe aaram dene ke liye mere haath se dol liya; unhon ne do dol nikale, un ke nikalne mein kamzori thi - Allah unhein maaf farmaye."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir Umar ibnul-Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) mere paas aaye aur un se le liya; kisi shakhs ne un ke nikalne jaisa nahin nikala, yahan tak ke log laut gaye aur hauz ubal raha tha."
"126","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tum Joor-Kirman se lado, ajam ki ek qaum, surkh chehre, chapti naakein, chhoti aankhein, goya un ke chehre madhi hui dhaalein hain."
"127","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qaim na hogi yahan tak ke tum aisi qaum se lado jin ki jootiyan baalon ki hongi."
"128","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Takabbur aur fakhr ghode-oont walon mein hai, aur sukoon bakri walon mein hai."
"129","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Log is mamle mein - mera khayal hai imarat murad hai - Quraish ke tabe hain: un ke Musalman un ke Musalmanon ke tabe, aur un ke kafir un ke kafiron ke tabe."
"130","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Oonton par sawar hone wali aurton mein sab se behtar Quraish ki nek aurtein hain: bachpan mein bachche par sab se zyada shafeeq aur shauhar ke maal mein sab se zyada hifazat karne wali."
"131","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Nazar haq hai."" Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne godne [washm] se mana farmaya."
"132","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi namaz mein rehta hai jab tak woh use roke rakhe, aur use nikalne se sirf us ka intezar rokta hai."
"133","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Oopar ka haath neeche ke haath se behtar hai, aur un se shuru kar jin ki tu parwarish karta hai."
"134","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Pehli aur aakhirat mein main logon mein Eesa ibne Maryam ka sab se zyada haqdar hoon."" Logon ne kaha: kaise, Ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nabi allati bhai hain, un ki maayein juda, aur un ka deen ek hai; to hamare darmiyan koi Nabi nahin."
"135","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek baar main soya tha, mujhe zameen ke khazane laye gaye, mere dono haathon mein sone ke do kangan rakhe gaye; woh mujh par bhari hue aur mujhe fikrmand kiya. Mujhe wahy ki gayi ke unhein phoonk maaroon, main ne phoonka to woh chale gaye. Main ne un ki tabeer do jhooton se ki jin ke darmiyan main hoon: San'a wale aur Yamama wale."
"136","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kisi ko us ka amal najat na dega, balke seedhe raho aur qareeb raho."" Logon ne kaha: Aap ko bhi nahin, Ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: ""Mujhe bhi nahin, siwaye is ke ke Allah mujhe apni taraf se rehmat aur fazl se dhaanp le."
"137","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do bai'a aur do libas se mana farmaya: tum mein se koi ek kapde mein ghutne samet kar na baithe jis par us ki sharmgah par kuch na ho, aur namaz mein apni izar na lapete siwaye is ke ke us ke dono kinare kandhe par mukhalif rakhe. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chhoone, phenkne [kankar] aur najash se mana farmaya."
"138","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Janwar, us ka zakhm maaf hai, kunwan maaf hai, ma'adan maaf hai, aag maaf hai; aur dafeene [rikaz] mein paanchwan [hissa] hai."
"139","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum jis basti mein aao aur us mein thehro to tumhara hissa hai"" - aur mera khayal hai farmaya: woh tumhari hai, ya isi jaisi baat. ""Aur jo basti Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani kare to us ka paanchwan Allah aur Us ke Rasool ka hai, phir woh tumhari hai."
